[h1]Cosmic Vault[/h1]
[i]The foundational core and shared library powering the Cosmic Mod Series.[/i]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]🚀 Version 2.0.0: The Vanilla+ Modding APIs[/h2]
Vault v2.0.0 brings a massive suite of [b]16 native Modding APIs![/b] From Dynamic Encounters and Economy crashes to custom Blueprint spawning and temporary Buffs, modders can now execute complex mechanics seamlessly—without ever performing dangerous, destructive hard-overrides on vanilla files.

[hr][/hr]

[h2]What is Cosmic Vault?[/h2]
Every great structure begins with a solid foundation. [b]Cosmic Vault[/b] serves as the essential, highly optimized backbone for the [b]Cosmic Series[/b] ([i]Cosmic Overhaul, Cosmic War and Cosmic Chronicles[/i]). It prevents memory bloat, eliminates duplicate code, and keeps your load order smooth by centralizing reusable code and assets.

[b]⚠️ REQUIRED DEPENDENCY:[/b] You [b]must[/b] be subscribed to Cosmic Vault to use any other Cosmic Series mod.

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Core Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]🛠️ [b]16 Vanilla+ Modding APIs:[/b] Effortlessly spawn custom XML ships, build missions, trigger cinematic UI banners, inject trade goods, and create dynamic encounters natively without hard overrides.
[*]💾 [b]Player Settings API:[/b] A robust engine-native storage API replacing crash-prone file systems, permanently solving UI and save corruption issues.
[*]📈 [b]Server Data Contracts:[/b] A highly-performant Faction Index API that prevents background loops from freezing your server.
[*]🗣️ [b]Shared Dialogue API:[/b] A narrative engine storing context-aware dialogue and rumors based on live simulations (like War Heat).
[*]🎨 [b]Shared Assets & UI Layouts:[/b] Hosts reusable textures and Proportional UI Splitters to decouple mods from legacy dependencies.
[*]🔧 [b]Unified Configuration:[/b] Centralized MCM support for the Cosmic ecosystem.
[/list]

